{"4280540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liminal Logistics", "steam_appid": 4280540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Deliveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level provides specific delivery tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the box, stock the correct items, and ship them out. Routes are not always direct, requiring navigation through different layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/bae62c1166f54fb9e6d5120b1befb3dc.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/bae62c1166f54fb9e6d5120b1befb3dc.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/bae62c1166f54fb9e6d5120b1befb3dc.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive A Hostile Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering boxes requires moving through dangerous, multi-level warehouse structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb ladders, traverse narrow platforms, and move across spaces while avoiding moving machinery and environmental hazards that can block or interrupt your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/f0d67b8a7bcd9e90764495901620647e.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/f0d67b8a7bcd9e90764495901620647e.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/f0d67b8a7bcd9e90764495901620647e.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deliver Faster, Earn More</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful deliveries reward you with money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiency is rewarded with better earnings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned money on The Union upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/81d9943480ad5bb290447a404def13fc.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/81d9943480ad5bb290447a404def13fc.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/81d9943480ad5bb290447a404def13fc.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Stamina </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sprint, jump and injury drains your energy. To replenish, you need to eat, drink and handle your bodily needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/9653e71d70d212029aa26b4cd870e153.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/9653e71d70d212029aa26b4cd870e153.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/9653e71d70d212029aa26b4cd870e153.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted Puzzle-Action Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, levels introduce:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More complex layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longer and riskier delivery routes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must adapt your movement, timing, and stamina usage to handle increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/36ed8a6f0627edda52e6057314257f55.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/36ed8a6f0627edda52e6057314257f55.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/36ed8a6f0627edda52e6057314257f55.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Deliveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level provides specific delivery tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the box, stock the correct items, and ship them out. Routes are not always direct, requiring navigation through different layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/bae62c1166f54fb9e6d5120b1befb3dc.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/bae62c1166f54fb9e6d5120b1befb3dc.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/bae62c1166f54fb9e6d5120b1befb3dc.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive A Hostile Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering boxes requires moving through dangerous, multi-level warehouse structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb ladders, traverse narrow platforms, and move across spaces while avoiding moving machinery and environmental hazards that can block or interrupt your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/f0d67b8a7bcd9e90764495901620647e.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/f0d67b8a7bcd9e90764495901620647e.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/f0d67b8a7bcd9e90764495901620647e.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deliver Faster, Earn More</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successful deliveries reward you with money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiency is rewarded with better earnings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned money on The Union upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/81d9943480ad5bb290447a404def13fc.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/81d9943480ad5bb290447a404def13fc.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/81d9943480ad5bb290447a404def13fc.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Stamina </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sprint, jump and injury drains your energy. To replenish, you need to eat, drink and handle your bodily needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/9653e71d70d212029aa26b4cd870e153.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/9653e71d70d212029aa26b4cd870e153.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/9653e71d70d212029aa26b4cd870e153.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted Puzzle-Action Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, levels introduce:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More complex layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longer and riskier delivery routes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must adapt your movement, timing, and stamina usage to handle increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/36ed8a6f0627edda52e6057314257f55.poster.avif?t=1781103053\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/36ed8a6f0627edda52e6057314257f55.webm?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/extras/36ed8a6f0627edda52e6057314257f55.mp4?t=1781103053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A first-person action simulator where you pick up a box, check the order, stock the right items, and complete as many orders as you can. To level up and unlock new ways of delivering, you must survive a wide variety of handcrafted levels with different objectives.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/54fd8b9bd5f0733f2d6ec63edf22b7dde69efb7a/header.jpg?t=1781103053", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/b5c8838290a561b16cf833d0abef83cf74b60aa0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781103053", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280540/b5c8838290a561b16cf833d0abef83cf74b60aa0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781103053", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 7600K / Ryzen 5 2600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 2070 / AMD 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice"